# Recorded input for the slider page (widgets/slider.zig, `Page`), at 320 x 120 in the default
# theme: the Volume track (0..100, at 50) at x 12..308, y 38..46, and the Gain track (-12..12,
# at 0) at x 12..308, y 79..87. One line per frame below (format: input.Replay). Scancodes:
# Left 80, Home 74, End 77, Page Down 78.
# 0: rest
frame
viewport 320 120
dt 0.016
pointer 300 110
# 1: press Volume at a quarter: 25
frame
pointer 86 42
buttons left
# 2: drag to three quarters: 75
frame
pointer 234 42
# 3: drag past the right end: 100
frame
pointer 315 100
# 4: release
frame
buttons
# 5: Left on the focused Volume: 99
frame
press 80
# 6: Home: 0
frame
press 74
# 7: press Gain at its middle, release: 0
frame
pointer 160 83
buttons left
# 8: release, then End: 12
frame
buttons
press 77
# 9: Page Down: 9.6
frame
press 78
# 10: a key with Shift held does nothing
frame
press 80 shift
